#!/usr/bin/env bash
fuzzel --dmenu --prompt '  ' --placeholder 'keybinds' --lines 25 --width 52 >/dev/null <<'K'
SUPER Return          terminal
SUPER Space / R       launcher
SUPER E               files
SUPER B               browser
SUPER V               clipboard history
SUPER W               pick wallpaper (re-themes everything)
SUPER ALT W           wallpaper list
SUPER I               settings
SUPER SHIFT W         random wallpaper
SUPER Q               close window
SUPER F / M           fullscreen / maximize
SUPER T               toggle floating
SUPER C / P           center / pin floating
SUPER J               toggle split
SUPER G               toggle group
ALT Tab               window switcher (SHIFT = this workspace only)
SUPER Tab             workspace overview
SUPER h k / ←↓↑→     focus (SHIFT move, CTRL resize)
SUPER 1-0             workspace (SHIFT = send window)
SUPER ` / [ / ]       last / prev / next workspace
SUPER S / ALT S       scratchpad / send to scratchpad
SUPER N / SHIFT N     do-not-disturb / clear notifications
SUPER CTRL B          toggle bar
SUPER ALT P           pipes
Print / SUPER SHIFT S screenshot region (SHIFT Print = screen)
SUPER L / Escape      lock
SUPER SHIFT Escape    power menu
K
